### ─── User management endpoints ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### Uses the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
### All user endpoints require an ADMIN bearer token.
###
### Quick start:
###   1. Start the API:  npm start
###   2. Send the "LOGIN as admin" request below.
###   3. Use "Send Request" on any of the user endpoints.

@host = http://localhost
@port = 3000
@base = {{host}}:{{port}}/api


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LOGIN as admin (required before calling user endpoints)
### Expect: 200 + accessToken
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ── Store token for later requests ────────────────────────────────────────

@accessToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CREATE USER — admin creates a new pharmacist (AC1)
### Expect: 201 + created user
### A welcome email is sent asynchronously with a temporary password.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name createPharmacist
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Dr. Ana Lopez",
  "ci": "11223344",
  "email": "pharmacist.new@example.com",
  "role": "PHARMACIST",
  "regNumber": "FARM-2026-001"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CREATE USER — admin creates a cashier
### Expect: 201; regNumber is not required for non-pharmacist roles
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name createCashier
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Pedro Ramirez",
  "ci": "55667788",
  "email": "cashier.new@example.com",
  "role": "CASHIER"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CREATE USER — validation error: PHARMACIST without regNumber
### Expect: 400 with message "regNumber is required when role is PHARMACIST"
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Dr. No Reg",
  "ci": "98765432",
  "email": "noreg@example.com",
  "role": "PHARMACIST"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CREATE USER — validation error: duplicate email
### Expect: 409 EMAIL_EXISTS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Duplicate Email",
  "ci": "11111111",
  "email": "pharmacist.new@example.com",
  "role": "CASHIER"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LIST USERS — paginated, default page=1, pageSize=20
### Expect: 200 + { data, total, page, pageSize, totalPages }
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LIST USERS — with filters and pagination
### Query params: page, pageSize (max 100), role, active, q
### Expect: 200 + filtered paginated list
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/users?page=1&pageSize=5&role=PHARMACIST&active=true&q=Ana
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### GET USER BY ID — including soft-deactivated users
### Replace :id with a real user id from the list above.
### Expect: 200 + user
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name getUser
GET {{base}}/users/{{createPharmacist.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### UPDATE USER — full or partial update
### Expect: 200 + updated user
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/users/{{createPharmacist.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Dr. Ana Lopez Updated",
  "regNumber": "FARM-2026-999"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### DEACTIVATE USER — soft-delete / set active=false
### Expect: 200 + deactivated user
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/users/{{createCashier.response.body.id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ACTIVATE USER — restore a deactivated user
### Expect: 200 + restored user
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/users/{{createCashier.response.body.id}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### GET DEACTIVATED USER — still visible to admins
### Expect: 200 + user with active=false
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/users/{{createCashier.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FORBIDDEN — non-admin user tries to create a user
### First login as a pharmacist or cashier, then use that token here.
### Expect: 403 Forbidden
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name loginPharmacist
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pharmacist@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPharmacist.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Hacker",
  "ci": "99998888",
  "email": "hacker@example.com",
  "role": "CASHIER"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LAST ADMIN — cannot deactivate the only active admin
### First list users and copy the id of the seeded admin, then paste it below.
### Expect: 409 LAST_ADMIN
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/users?role=ADMIN&active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
PATCH {{base}}/users/PASTE_ADMIN_ID_HERE/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
